# Weaver — writes coordinate bonds early, then claims like the baseline.
# A bond scores when both endpoint scrolls are yours at episode end.

WHEN here unclaimed DO inscribe "bond anchor reference woven at the crossing"
WHEN turn < 3 DO inscribe "reference 1.1.1/1.1.1/1.1.1 and 1.1.1/1.1.1/3.3.3 held"
WHEN unclaimed adjacent DO move toward unclaimed
WHEN charge >= 10 DO move toward unclaimed
WHEN always DO attune
